WEBVTT

00:37:29.006 --> 00:37:30.506
and you can divide it well,

00:37:30.530 --> 00:37:33.149
and if we talk about
how to do that effectively,

00:37:33.173 --> 00:37:34.344
we need to do it."

00:37:34.368 --> 00:37:37.545
But there comes a time
that there needs reforms.

00:37:37.569 --> 00:37:40.903
And those reforms
have to create productivity.

00:37:40.927 --> 00:37:43.093
It doesn't mean just give money away.

00:37:43.117 --> 00:37:46.125
It means, how do you make
those people productive,

00:37:46.149 --> 00:37:49.576
so that they're also
psychologically productive

00:37:49.600 --> 00:37:51.577
as well as physically productive

00:37:51.601 --> 00:37:53.021
and producing output.

00:37:53.045 --> 00:37:54.442
You need to do that system.

00:37:54.466 --> 00:37:57.291
And so for reasons I wrote on that page,

00:37:57.315 --> 00:37:59.021
that post --

00:37:59.045 --> 00:38:01.037
it's on LinkedIn if people want it --